    "type": "game",
    "name": "Diceball",
    "steam_appid": 3666980,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666980/extras/40c6cd99b1034aa3c8df894e1454db53.avif?t=1750946412\" data-has-big width=800 height=98 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diceball: Where Strategy Meets Chance in the Ultimate Tabletop Sports Showdown!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll the dice and dominate the field in Diceball, a unique turn-based sports strategy game where your management skills are just as important as your luck. Take control of one of 8 distinct teams (7 to unlock) and guide them through a challenging championship run where every roll matters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666980/extras/56612310fb8ddf049776bfaebd035063.avif?t=1750946412\" data-has-big width=800 height=221 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Championship Challenge:</strong> Battle and win your way through 10 consecutive games to claim the ultimate Diceball trophy. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Team Building:</strong> Visit the Concession Stand between wins to purchase powerful upgrades and consumable cards. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Teams: </strong>Start with the default team, the Rain Delay Bay Rookies, and win to unlock 7 more teams, each with unique starting abilities and play-styles. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectible Card System:</strong> Build your Card Binder with new cards unlocked throughout your various championship runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk vs. Reward Gameplay:</strong> Make tough decisions that could lead to glorious victory or crushing defeat! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you master the perfect balance of strategy and chance to become the Diceball Champion? Every game brings new challenges and opportunities in this addictive baseball management experience! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666980/extras/be9199c162dad4f15f8ea7b660fcac7d.avif?t=1750946412\" data-has-big width=800 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666980/extras/40c6cd99b1034aa3c8df894e1454db53.avif?t=1750946412\" data-has-big width=800 height=98 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diceball: Where Strategy Meets Chance in the Ultimate Tabletop Sports Showdown!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll the dice and dominate the field in Diceball, a unique turn-based sports strategy game where your management skills are just as important as your luck. Take control of one of 8 distinct teams (7 to unlock) and guide them through a challenging championship run where every roll matters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666980/extras/56612310fb8ddf049776bfaebd035063.avif?t=1750946412\" data-has-big width=800 height=221 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Championship Challenge:</strong> Battle and win your way through 10 consecutive games to claim the ultimate Diceball trophy. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Team Building:</strong> Visit the Concession Stand between wins to purchase powerful upgrades and consumable cards. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Teams: </strong>Start with the default team, the Rain Delay Bay Rookies, and win to unlock 7 more teams, each with unique starting abilities and play-styles. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectible Card System:</strong> Build your Card Binder with new cards unlocked throughout your various championship runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk vs. Reward Gameplay:</strong> Make tough decisions that could lead to glorious victory or crushing defeat! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you master the perfect balance of strategy and chance to become the Diceball Champion? Every game brings new challenges and opportunities in this addictive baseball management experience! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666980/extras/be9199c162dad4f15f8ea7b660fcac7d.avif?t=1750946412\" data-has-big width=800 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Roll the dice and dominate in Diceball, a turn-based sports strategy game where luck meets skill. Guide your team through 10 consecutive wins to claim the championship. Unlock 8 unique teams, collect powerful upgrades at the Concession Stand, and build your team on your way to victory.",
